1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,570
My shop has a twin,
and it is backwards.

2
00:00:02,570 --> 00:00:03,110
I'm Mara.

3
00:00:03,110 --> 00:00:05,710
My mother vanished,
and the signs know why.

4
00:00:06,450 --> 00:00:08,250
Number nine doesn't exist.

5
00:00:08,250 --> 00:00:09,790
So why is it open?

6
00:00:09,660 --> 00:00:10,390
Great question.

7
00:00:10,390 --> 00:00:11,710
Let's never find out.

8
00:00:11,620 --> 00:00:12,240
That's Zip.

9
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:13,130
He's a cat sign.

10
00:00:13,130 --> 00:00:14,490
He's also a coward.

11
00:00:14,340 --> 00:00:16,550
I'm fragile. It
says so on my box.

12
00:00:16,740 --> 00:00:18,880
Nine years ago, my
mother walked out.

13
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:21,670
She left me her coat, and
one word in the glass.

14
00:00:21,670 --> 00:00:22,260
Wait.

15
00:00:22,310 --> 00:00:23,610
I'm done waiting.

16
00:00:24,670 --> 00:00:26,170
Mara. This is our shop.

17
00:00:26,150 --> 00:00:27,220
Backwards.

18
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:29,150
Oh no. I look
terrible backwards.

19
00:00:29,270 --> 00:00:30,870
And then the lamp came on.

20
00:00:30,850 --> 00:00:32,320
Please tell me you did that.

21
00:00:32,440 --> 00:00:34,360
There was fresh
glass on the bench.

22
00:00:34,360 --> 00:00:35,260
Still warm.

23
00:00:35,520 --> 00:00:36,680
Don't. Don't what?

24
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:37,930
Turn.

25
00:00:38,130 --> 00:00:38,360
Mara?

26
00:00:38,360 --> 00:00:39,960
Someone is sitting behind us.

27
00:00:40,010 --> 00:00:41,660
So of course, I turned.

28
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:44,390
She was wearing
my mother's coat.
